## Why This Is Asked

Tests CGO callback patterns, cross-language memory ownership, and thread-safety for asynchronous C-to-Go workflows.

## Key Concepts

- CGO callback bridge between C and Go
- Per-id registry with synchronization
- Memory ownership across boundaries (strdup/free)
- Safe cleanup without leaks in multi-threaded contexts

